        "",
        "Closing the compile-to-results gap: graded checks math offline, but nothing executed papers on nanoGPT. These runners do - each takes the live path model + data, runs the integrated pipeline, writes `outputs/<paper>_results.json` in the style of the paper repos' own run summaries (SABER `results_map`/LayerMix metrics style). Plain ALWAYS-PRESENT codeblocks (bundle rule): runners orchestrate, they never change the model.",
