        "### Compatibility: RiLM: Parameter-Efficient Language Modeling via Geodesic Decoding (Li 2026, arXiv:2609.10305)",
        "",
        "- **STACK:** geodesic head + every Vocab (savings grow with |V|; head shares the table by construction) / Scale / Context / State / Arch / Attn path; budget cell + any live model; smoke runner + any get_batch; checkpoint probing tracks PPL either way.",
        "- **ALTERNATIVE (pick 1):** lm_head Linear (matmul) | AdderConvLinear (addernetmatmul) | GeodesicHead (geodesicflat) - same site, same shapes; flat | hyp (hyp unimplemented: needs Mobius stack, ball projection, c=1.0/lr 3e-3/clip; Table IX collapse is the failure mode to re-test when built).",
        "- **NEVER-SAME-PATH:** separate (untied) embedding copy alongside GeodesicHead (doubles params, breaks tying-constraint design); hyp Mobius ops applied to Euclidean states; Table VIII-style full-vocab leaderboard claims from 2k-vocab runs (paper's own warning).",
